cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "quantum-group: Symbolic modelling and verification of U_q(sl_2) and GL_q(2|1) quantum group structures in Python"
abstract: >-
  A SymPy-based package for symbolic modelling and reproducible,
  representation-level verification of quantum group structures:
  finite-dimensional U_q(sl_2) representations, Hopf algebra axioms,
  tensor products and Clebsch-Gordan decompositions, R-matrices with
  Yang-Baxter, braid and Hecke relation checks, the graded Yang-Baxter
  equation for GL_q(2|1), and crystal graphs.
authors:
